=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to Maat on a level 61+ job. He will give you four clues and wishes for you to trade a {i:Kindred's Seal|Kindred's Seal|1127} to the people described in the clues. You are not provided with the Kindred's Seals and will need to procure them in order to complete this quest.

* Check your storage {p:Satchel, Sack, or Case|Inventory 101} (the command /itemsearch "Kindred's seal" can help), and/or with {z:Port Jeuno} NPCs {n:Shemo} and {n:Shami} (Menu -> Status -> Currencies -> Kindred's Seals Stored), as you may already have enough seals. Not to be confused with {i:Kindred's Crest|Kindred's Crest|2955} which drops on level 70+ mobs.

* A reminder that {i:Kindred's seals|Kindred's Seal|1127} can be acquired from:
** Any normal mob level 50-69 that checks as Easy Prey or higher.
** Exchanged 3:1 (or 2:1 during {p:certain campaigns|Category:Adventurer Campaigns}) for other seal types from {n:Shemo}.
** The {p:Greeter Moogle} for 5 points each, if redemption for a login points campaign is currently active.
*** Note that you'll need 5 seals more for {q:New Worlds Await|New Worlds Await|New Worlds Await}, so you may wish to acquire them at the same time - which together would be 9 total for 45 points.

* In return for a Seal, you will receive either a {@k} {k:Smiling stone}, {@k} {k:Scowling stone}, {@k} {k:Somber stone}, or {@k} {k:Spirited stone}.
** Three clues will refer to someone in one person each in {p:San d'Oria}, {p:Bastok}, and {p:Windurst}.
** The final clue will refer to someone in either {z:Selbina} or {z:Mhaura}.
** The above are in no particular order, but all four locations are guaranteed.
* Speak to Maat once you have all four stones to complete the quest.

